        <span id="ContentPlaceHolder1_LinkPaperPage_LinkPaperContent_PaperTopics" class="PublicationsDetailNormal">Application Integration Technologies; Development of Cyber-physical Systems; Reliability and Security; Safety, Security and Compliance; Software Development Methodologies; SSE for Machine and Deep Learning</span>
        <div id="ContentPlaceHolder1_LinkPaperPage_LinkPaperContent_ProceedingsInfoDiv">
